2026-11-08T13:41:40.2144 
2026-11-08T13:41:40.4147 Typing a<value><enter> will set a new damping between between 0.50 and 10.00 set 50 to 1000
2026-11-08T13:41:40.4148 Typing b<value><enter> will set a new tempRef between 1 and 1023
2026-11-08T13:41:40.6150 Typing c<value><enter> will set a new tempCoeff set between 0 and 10000. Adding 10000 gives negative tc
2026-11-08T13:41:40.6151 Typing d<value><enter> will set a new dacValue between 1 and 65535
2026-11-08T13:41:40.8154 Typing e<value><enter> will erase the 3 hour storage in EEPROM if value 1 and all EEPROM if 22 (33 sets all EEPROM to FF)
2026-11-08T13:41:40.8155 Typing g<value><enter> will set a new gain between 10 and 65535
2026-11-08T13:41:41.0158   gain = (65536/settable VCOrange in ppb) (eg. 100ppb DACrange gives gain=655)
2026-11-08T13:41:41.0158 Typing h<value><enter> will set hold mode and the entered dacValue if not h0 that uses the old
2026-11-08T13:41:41.2162 Typing i<value><enter> with value 1 will toggle ns decimal point else will toggle amount of information 
2026-11-08T13:41:41.2163 Typing j<value><enter> Set temp sensor type 0=raw 1=LM35 2=10kNTC+68k 3=10kNTC+47k (second digit=adc1 eg 3x)
2026-11-08T13:41:41.4166 Typing l<enter> will set TIC linearization parameters min max square
2026-11-08T13:41:41.4168   values 1-500 sets min to 0.1-50, values 800-1023 sets max, values 1024-1200 sets square to 0.024-0.200
2026-11-08T13:41:41.4169 Typing n<value><enter> will set ID number 0-65535 that is displayed 
2026-11-08T13:41:41.6172 Typing o<value><enter> will set a new TIC_Offset between 10 and 1020 ns
2026-11-08T13:41:41.6173 Typing p<value><enter> will set a new prefilter div between 2 and 4
2026-11-08T13:41:41.6174 Typing r<enter> will set run mode
2026-11-08T13:41:41.8176 Typing s<value><enter> will save gain etc to EEPROM if value 1 and dacvalue if 2
2026-11-08T13:41:41.8177 Typing t<value><enter> will set a new time constant between 4 and 32000 seconds
2026-11-08T13:41:42.0180 Typing w<value><enter> will set a new warmup time between 2 and 1000 seconds
